        "code_body": "```c\nfloat total_score, max_score, min_score, now_score;\nfor (int i = 0; i < 25; i++) {\n    max_score = 0; // 记录最高分\n    min_score = 10; // 记录最低分\n    total_score = 0; // 记录总分\n\n    for (int j = 0; j < 10; j++) {\n    cin >> now_score; // 录入评委打分\n\n    max_score = max(max_score, now_score); // L1\n    min_score = min(min_score, now_score); // L2\n\n    total_score += now_score;\n    }\n\n    cout << (total_score - max_score - min_score);\n}\n```",
